UPDATE "City" SET "published" = 1, "intro" = 'Island Park''s listing is MJ Social, a mahjong studio on Long Beach Road on the South Shore of Long Island. It runs beginner lessons that teach the National Mah Jongg League card and the Charleston, plus frequent open play. Sessions are posted on its site and fill up, so check the date and price before you go.' WHERE "slug" = 'island-park';
